  (.-expr re))










^{:go/end 117} (go/method Copy "Copy returns a new [Regexp] object copied from re.\nCalling [Regexp.Longest] on one copy does not affect another.\n\nDeprecated: In earlier releases, when using a [Regexp] in multiple goroutines,\ngiving each goroutine its own copy helped to avoid lock contention.\nAs of Go 1.12, using Copy is no longer necessary to avoid lock contention.\nCopy may still be appropriate if the reason for its use is to make\ntwo copies with different [Regexp.Longest] settings.\n" ^{:tag (* Regexp)} [^{:tag (* Regexp)} re]
